# Dedicated bond-live-daily image: the COMPLETE closure of the root
# requirements.txt, with the numeric stack pinned to the exact versions the
# DG-4 round 003 rebuild was reproduced on (Python 3.13.12 / numpy 2.5.1 /
# pandas 3.0.3 / scipy 1.18.0 / pyarrow 25.0.0; psycopg 3.3.3 = the frozen
# artifact loader's lock). Every other line is the root file's range, so the
# hash lock below is a strict refinement of what Nixpacks would have resolved,
# never a different dependency set. Edit the root requirements.txt FIRST, then
# mirror it here and regenerate the lock (see requirements.lock header).
#
# The daily service runs every stage in ONE interpreter (bond_live_daily ->
# bond_metrics / bond_serving / bond_panel -> bond_market_implied_rating), and
# panel_resolvers imports statsmodels, so the lock must cover the full daily
# closure, not only the four packages the artifact loader pins.
